 =?UTF-8?q?lter=20shows=20every=20machine=20checked?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- With no machine filter (All machines), every machine in the menu shows as checked instead of none.
- Cmd-click (Ctrl-click off macOS) on a machine while all are shown removes just that machine, so "all but one" is two clicks: All machines, then Cmd-click the one to hide.
- Stored keys still use an empty list for all machines; stale ids alone also count as all.

Files:
- apps/web: sidebarEnvironmentScope.ts, components/sidebar/SidebarMachineRow.tsx
- docs: user/thread-sidebar.md

Tests:
- apps/web: sidebarEnvironmentScope.test.ts (additive toggle from all machines and from stale-only keys)
